     "analytics_storage is set to denied, so GA4 does not create or read its cookies (such as _ga).",
     "GA4 still receives cookieless pings, which are basic signals that a page view or event happened. These pings carry no cookie identifier.",
     "Because there is no cookie, GA4 cannot recognise the same visitor across pages or visits. So that visitor’s sessions and users are not counted normally.",
