     "Allow only a list of approved fields.",
     "Add or change fields, such as adding the product’s profit margin.",
     "The tag’s own settings. The GA4 server tag lets you exclude or override event parameters. For example, you can override the IP address field so GA4 does not receive the visitor’s full IP.",
